The final runtime image is also built on a `debian:bookworm-slim` base image
(pinned by digest in Dockerfile), which itself bundles ca-certificates, git,
and python3 plus their own transitive dependencies under a variety of licenses
(GPL-2.0, GPL-3.0, LGPL, PSF-2.0, and others). The full composition of the
published image, including base-image packages, is enumerated in the SPDX
SBOM attached to each release as an OCI attestation -- see "Supply chain
security" in README.md for how to inspect it.
